        <mxCell id="uz-wZKXDxPcc2NML6rjB-68" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Code de l&#39;urbanisme&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: -0.5em 0px 0px 1.6em; margin-inline: 1.6em 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; animation-delay: -0.01ms !important; animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: 0ms !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;animation-delay: -0.01ms !important; animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: 0ms !important; margin-bottom: 0.1em;&quot;&gt;Livre&amp;nbsp;&lt;abbr style=&quot;border-bottom: 0px; cursor: help; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-style: initial; animation-delay: -0.01ms !important; animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: 0ms !important;&quot; title=&quot;premier&quot; class=&quot;abbr&quot;&gt;I&lt;sup style=&quot;animation-delay: -0.01ms !important; animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: 0ms !important; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;er&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/abbr&gt;&amp;nbsp;: réglementation de l&#39;urbanisme&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;animation-delay: -0.01ms !important; animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: 0ms !important; margin-bottom: 0.1em;&quot;&gt;Livre II&amp;nbsp;: préemption et réserves foncières&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;animation-delay: -0.01ms !important; animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: 0ms !important; margin-bottom: 0.1em;&quot;&gt;Livre III&amp;nbsp;: aménagement foncier&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=